    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VINCENT'S EPIC ADVENTURE AWAITS YOU!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Map Of Materials, you'll find him stranded on a mysterious island where he uses all his skills and knowledge to escape and return to his old life to return home. Will he make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/80787563bd066bf041f9c408d100b71f.avif?t=1754374067\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brace yourself as you step into the dark ruins, where mysterious and dangerous creatures lurk. It seems like everything here has a grudge against Vincent and wants him dead, so be on high alert. While exploring the island, you might stumble upon some pretty awesome things that could come in handy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/59b533bc280af716194e0c169ae0fbde.avif?t=1754374067\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each area of the island you discover will offer new findings and resources as you and Vincent are faced with new challenges to solve. How will you find shelter in the icy winter climate? Will you manage to escape the castle ruins or the sand labyrinth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/d1af7d2e9f4565f5fd3c7b133678f708.avif?t=1754374067\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IT WON'T BE EASY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game doesn't tell you where to go and what to do next. Vincent's entire journey depends on your problem solving and gaming skills. On his way back home you will encounter strange creatures and have to escape many dangers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/bd2662073a8f2cdb486330059a797ee0.avif?t=1754374067\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> - Discover an Open World From a Third-Person View</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/dc472d56cbe04de036adb4fda50139d1.poster.avif?t=1754374067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/dc472d56cbe04de036adb4fda50139d1.webm?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/dc472d56cbe04de036adb4fda50139d1.mp4?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terrain</strong> - Caves, Ruins, Tombs, Various Biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/7ef4bfff3f59eb79c6ac45a32eabb5b4.poster.avif?t=1754374067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/7ef4bfff3f59eb79c6ac45a32eabb5b4.webm?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/7ef4bfff3f59eb79c6ac45a32eabb5b4.mp4?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive</strong> - To Survive, You'll Need to Ration Your Food</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/e0268d9d958b38c9cbefaefff0701889.poster.avif?t=1754374067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/e0268d9d958b38c9cbefaefff0701889.webm?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/e0268d9d958b38c9cbefaefff0701889.mp4?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat</strong> - With Various Weapons &amp; Magic, You'll Fight Angry Creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/9fcc5031565a22c532f7a3ff640519eb.poster.avif?t=1754374067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/9fcc5031565a22c532f7a3ff640519eb.webm?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/9fcc5031565a22c532f7a3ff640519eb.mp4?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Improve</strong> - During the Game, You Can Enhance Your Armor and Weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/972db6c4f3b8ad36b028b2f0a694a57d.poster.avif?t=1754374067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/972db6c4f3b8ad36b028b2f0a694a57d.webm?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/972db6c4f3b8ad36b028b2f0a694a57d.mp4?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft &amp; Mining</strong> - Create New Items to Help You Survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/bb82fcfb428c9e7233988f571fbd2ae2.poster.avif?t=1754374067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/bb82fcfb428c9e7233988f571fbd2ae2.webm?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/bb82fcfb428c9e7233988f571fbd2ae2.mp4?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loot</strong> - Find Hidden Items that Improve Your Skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/d5a72e36ab35263f88614573a0d61d90.poster.avif?t=1754374067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/d5a72e36ab35263f88614573a0d61d90.webm?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/d5a72e36ab35263f88614573a0d61d90.mp4?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quests</strong> - Adventure Deeper Through the Game as You Explore the World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/0ff98d60765910835b4e1046536687e5.poster.avif?t=1754374067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/0ff98d60765910835b4e1046536687e5.webm?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/0ff98d60765910835b4e1046536687e5.mp4?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzles</strong> - Various Puzzles You Will Encounter on Your Journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/5a9c042af1c82a6f54ab3b5fcfaa0135.poster.avif?t=1754374067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/5a9c042af1c82a6f54ab3b5fcfaa0135.webm?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/5a9c042af1c82a6f54ab3b5fcfaa0135.mp4?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kind regards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mike</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VINCENT'S EPIC ADVENTURE AWAITS YOU!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Map Of Materials, you'll find him stranded on a mysterious island where he uses all his skills and knowledge to escape and return to his old life to return home. Will he make it out alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/80787563bd066bf041f9c408d100b71f.avif?t=1754374067\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brace yourself as you step into the dark ruins, where mysterious and dangerous creatures lurk. It seems like everything here has a grudge against Vincent and wants him dead, so be on high alert. While exploring the island, you might stumble upon some pretty awesome things that could come in handy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/59b533bc280af716194e0c169ae0fbde.avif?t=1754374067\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each area of the island you discover will offer new findings and resources as you and Vincent are faced with new challenges to solve. How will you find shelter in the icy winter climate? Will you manage to escape the castle ruins or the sand labyrinth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/d1af7d2e9f4565f5fd3c7b133678f708.avif?t=1754374067\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IT WON'T BE EASY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game doesn't tell you where to go and what to do next. Vincent's entire journey depends on your problem solving and gaming skills. On his way back home you will encounter strange creatures and have to escape many dangers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/bd2662073a8f2cdb486330059a797ee0.avif?t=1754374067\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong> - Discover an Open World From a Third-Person View</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/dc472d56cbe04de036adb4fda50139d1.poster.avif?t=1754374067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/dc472d56cbe04de036adb4fda50139d1.webm?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/dc472d56cbe04de036adb4fda50139d1.mp4?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terrain</strong> - Caves, Ruins, Tombs, Various Biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/7ef4bfff3f59eb79c6ac45a32eabb5b4.poster.avif?t=1754374067\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/7ef4bfff3f59eb79c6ac45a32eabb5b4.webm?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1809500/extras/7ef4bfff3f59eb79c6ac45a32eabb5b4.mp4?t=1754374067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive</strong> - To Survive, You'll Need to Ration Your Food</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">